189	// fetchGroupMembers calls the format-specific group endpoint which reliably
190	// includes memberNames: GET /v1/repositories/{format}/group/{name}
191	// Requires nx-repository-admin privilege; falls back to anonymous when credentials fail.
192	//
193	// It returns a settled listing (non-nil, possibly empty) or an error, never a
194	// silent "no members": a 401, a 403 or Nexus's 404 Repository not found is a *MembersRefusedError, anything else that
195	// goes wrong is returned as it is. The caller caches the first and must not cache
196	// the second (D23).
